    },
    {
        "text": "Harmonie's status as a spy has been confirmed, but the intelligence personnel she planted have all evacuated in advance under her cover.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected is indeed another Draco. Where she's headed is within our grasp. As soon as you give the orders, my team will continue our pursuit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "On another note... Pardon me for asking, but to the one listening to this report from behind the screen\u2014are you the head, or... the Duke herself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very sharp of you. I don't remember how many years it's been since I last met a youth who could single that out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pardon me, I'd just like to enjoy this cup of tea first. Come, take a seat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, being Infected, I'm best off standing here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you came, did you see the little theater on the street corner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I did... It wasn't open, and no suspicious persons were loitering there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That theater was built by a group of self-proclaimed Taran artists. Every night, they put on plays based on Taran culture there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you need me to investigate them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, their existence is one I much admire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for capturing the Draco, you needn't worry. I'll have someone else take care of it. The intelligence you brought is highly valuable. Given your talents, we shouldn't be wasting your time on clean-up work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would like you to surveil the Duke of Wellington's movements from a specified location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. I thank you for your appreciation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yes, as for our prior question. Have you decided on your answer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
