    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hi, Miss Messenger, how far can you deliver letters? As far as you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could you help me write one, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a word or two. I just want to let my family know I'm still alive...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g1_victoriavillage",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you heard the farmer just now. Caravans pass through this area regularly. There'll be one in half an hour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Follow the caravan, and if you can hide in their transports, all the better. The regions around County Oak Grove should be the Duke of Wellington's territory. He won't permit transgressions against the Tarans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll be in grave danger if you miss this chance. The search team will make their way here from the nearest nomadic city as quickly as they can. It won't take them even an hour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you manage to make it out, you won't have to worry about your future. It's me who they're after. If they lose track of you, they won't pursue you any further.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, wait... so, when Bagpipe said you were Dublinn's Leader, that wasn't just me hearing things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. If any of you still want to fight alongside Dublinn, you can come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Dublinn's name won't shield you, and the road ahead may be much the same as what we're experiencing now... monitored by many, continually chased.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, I'm back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did what you said and talked to her. Said everyone who escaped the village with me decided to settle down here, and made up a place name that doesn't exist in the Sc\u00e1thanna Fields.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, that Messenger seemed a nice lass, though... If she's an actual Messenger, not just someone here to investigate us, we'd be sending her on this trip in vain, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I've spent most of my life in hiding. I've seen plenty of people in pursuit, disguising themselves as Messengers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Alright. Suppose that's how it is from now on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop sighing so much. We need to divvy up our supplies while we've still got the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're hurt. Don't force yourself to go with Reed. We'll fight the Tarans' fight for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_729_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. I count as having fought for the Tarans, then, eh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Injured Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Reed, a moment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something I need to tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 200,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd wrote about it in my will, but... *sigh*... well, I survived, so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm. What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You see... I was the one who bashed the soldier with the hoe. I'm the reason everyone has to go on the run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That night, I saw him beating\u2014beating the Tullys' little girl. So I picked up a hoe someone set aside, and beat him on the head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "shake",
        "power": 2,
        "times": 60,
        "fadetime": 0.4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm shaking, aren't I? I... *sigh* I really am sorry. It's been so long, and I still dream about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was only fourteen. She was screaming, crying, and it... it got to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know I figured, it was so dark out, no lamps allowed and all, so it didn't matter if it might've cracked his skull, shed some blood. Wouldn't have seen it no matter how bad it was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... didn't expect I'd mess this up for so many people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Afterwards, I thought I'd go with them and try to help everyone settle down, and then I'd leave to atone for my mistakes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But some of us never even made it, in the end, to a place we could settle down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you make up the charge\u2014about not having your papers in order?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*. I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was worried they'd be suspicious when I wasn't on the wanted posters initially. That's why I went to the pharmacy with Fergal... and then I dragged you into this mess too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say that, Fionn. My identity was bound\u2014to catch up to me one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Tarans' sorrow\u2014is bound to catch up to everyone, one day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright... alright, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Moran. Do you want to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Fionn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, nothing. Here, pass me the rope. You won't get very far tying up your luggage up like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh. Fine, you're the expert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you're following Reed into the fight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm. Selmon said I've got the strength to get a lot of things done for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you can't see when there's no light... That'll be hard on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's war we're talking about. You'll face far more, far greater enemies than we did that night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cannons, too. War isn't like the plays, where the heroes take a cut, bleed a drop, fall and climb back up. In real life, people die the ugliest deaths in no time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But. This is the path I want to choose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I rarely ever get the chance to choose, and I want to take it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The caravan's coming in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, I'll negotiate with them to carry the injured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed... Can I go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I leave, the way I am now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
