    },
    {
        "text": "Top Deck of High-Speed Battleship <i>Gastrell</i>"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A rib taken from what was once the greatest nomadic city, furnished with the crystallization of the Victorian military's technological prowess. Most should be proud of having the privilege to board this battleship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even across all of Terra, I doubt there exists a military machine as worthy of admiration as this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I expect no less from something bearing the name of a legendary officer under the Draco.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure many have sought to track it, trying to fathom where you stand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But after a seven year journey, today is finally the day it comes to shore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many Messengers are on the way to report the news of our change of course?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Duke of Caster and many others besides are paying close attention, but none of their armies will be able to interfere in time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "County Oak Grove has stopped sailing and is ready to link. This is the first time in seven years our ship comes anywhere close to a nomadic city, but there'll be little resupplying or maintenance needed while we're docked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "His Lordship has indicated he'll personally receive you at the dock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Those Aslan lapdogs. So hesitant, so indolent, they may never even find out who this city truly belongs to until this ship has made it to County Oak Grove.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And they have no idea of the fires that will rise again thence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dublinn's army, the Tarans who thirst to be released from this injustice, have made their way here from every part of Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "My strategist... has done very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has my city stopped where I hoped it to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Given terrain limitations and safety considerations, this is the position closest to the ruins that this city's course can reach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think, Princess Eblana? You paid those ruins a visit on your way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think this will suffice. It doesn't matter how highly those who clamor for the restoration of Taran culture think of King Gaeil's palace. It's ultimately no more than a decaying ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the time comes, the romanticist dreamers need only catch one glimpse of it through the wild morning mist, and it will sink in that what once stood atop the hills perished in Catastrophe. That will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "From what I hear, once the Taran dynasty fell and the Dracos fled, the Aslans let that castle stand empty until the day Catastrophe claimed it. The Tarans have all but forgotten it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The remnants of that olden dynasty... were never of any intrigue to begin with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "The title of King Gaeil was bestowed upon him by Victoria's regent. He was no more than a more celebrated servant. If his crown was still extant, I would destroy it. If his throne still remained, I would render it ashes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the place lacks even those to speak of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hence why the young Warwick sought to rediscover Taran history starting from the legend of King Gaeil. A fine thing to do, really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean 'The Eulogist' Warwick, the 'Warwick of the Northern Front?' ...Oh, so you knew him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I once sent an envoy to one of his parties. This battleship began its patrol right around that time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always been of great foresight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd hardly call it much of a long wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "County Oak Grove... Say, are you keen on seeing it for yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Wellington"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I'm very curious how it's rebuilt itself since that great fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_652_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_722_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, I once called it home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$burningloop1",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "kfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "My elder sister's spear in hand, I stand in the hallway for some time."
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone in the manor hangs their heads in silence, trying to keep busy. The moment they see me, they avert their gaze."
    },
    {
        "text": "Our teacher's health has been poor. He hasn't left his room since making his way back through a snowstorm from a dinner party. Dr. Dale readied him the mulled wine, yet hasn't been punctual in fetching the empty glass."
    },
    {
        "text": "The muted sounds of crackling wood seep through the gaps in the door. The fireplace must be a bed of warmth on this snowy night, but the flames' eerie silence makes my teeth chatter."
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonetheless, I open the door."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$rebel_intro",
        "key": "$rebel_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_open_door",
        "volume": 1
